{"ID":"20240118151428-pse97cc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240118151428-pse97cc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151428-pse97cc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151428-kgx6jlo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240606172021-6p5r941\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240606172021-6p5r941\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"011曾青","type":"doc","updated":"20240606172021"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151428-kgx6jlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151428-kgx6jlo","updated":"20240119115137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味酸小寒，主目痛止泪出，风痹利关节，通九窍，破症瘕积聚，久服轻身不老，能化金铜。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115127-4ttzg7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115127-4ttzg7j","updated":"20240119115138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫，疗头风，脑中寒，止烦渴，补不足，盛阴气。味酸性小寒无毒，目痛止泪出，风痹，利关节，通九窍，破症瘕积聚。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115129-cw16c7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115129-cw16c7v","updated":"20240119115139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫，疗头风，脑中寒，止烦渴，补不足，盛阴气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115131-jix3h9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115131-jix3h9o","updated":"20240119115140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【炮制】拣去杂质即可。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115141-u4szd1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115141-u4szd1g"}},{"ID":"20240119115141-ni1ws5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115141-ni1ws5m"}},{"ID":"20240119115141-ldti6zy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115141-ldti6zy","updated":"20240125094248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青跟空青一样，产于铜坑中，跟空青非常的类似，只是颜色有一点差异。空青，代表里面有水，青色的石头里面有水，曾青里面没有水，这个东西差不多。一般来说，金石类的药，像只有这些空青，曾青，还有这个芒硝啊，石胆那，这些药，我们是不需要熟用，直接去渣就可以用了，磨碎去渣就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240119115147-2h3craf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115147-2h3craf","updated":"20240125094337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金石类的药的功能，我讲过，都接近，非常的雷同，一般来说，我们头虱，外用比较多。头虱啊，以前用DDT，我们小的时候，头上长虱，那虱会传染，头包起来，喷DDT，头包起来，杀掉它，把虱子杀掉，那还有乡下的太太那，不晓得DDT，把农药散进去，她想，我家用农药杀虫嘛，那能把虫干掉，把农药撒进去，那结果一拿，头发都不见了。过去什么状况都有的，这是虱子。实际上，我们中药，这种石类的药，都可以杀虫的，把他们磨成粉，撒上去，洗一下，杀虫力很强，杀百虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240606172021-6p5r941","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606172021-6p5r941"}}]}